  "topic": "selection_range",
  "subtopic": "syntax_ranges",
  "title": "Function signatures",
  "summary": "A function's name is selected with its signature before the whole declaration",
  "prose": "The signature runs from the return type, or from the name of a\nconstructor, through the parameters and the rest of the function's type,\nsuch as `const noexcept` or a trailing return type.",
